# A named edge's row on a chamfer's screen hovers and selects the edge
# on the model: the chamfer of ext_chamfer_solid_edge, of the edge where
# the notch of testdata/topo/slot.tlspr meets the front, picked on the
# model; the mouse over the edge's row on the screen hovers it, and a
# click selects it, both on the solid before the chamfer, where the
# edge still is.
file $testdata/topo/slot.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 335 425
down L 335 425
up L 335 425
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
tw
twmove 96 185
dump
twdown L 96 185
twup L 96 185
dump
tw
